  //
  //   * morning-briefing SKILL.md pre-flight short-circuit on `--cadence lens_shift`
  //     (skip step 3a read-memory AND step 3a.5 gather-semantic-related)
  //   * cold-mode write contract (type / slug / body exclusions)
